{"type":"message","id":"664def7d","parentId":"46026ed4","timestamp":"2026-04-29T17:38:39.713Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Zeeshan is asking for specific financial advice regarding SOL (Solana) - \"Tell me now I go long short on SOL coin\".\n\n1. **Safety/Policy Check:** I must not provide financial, investment, or trading advice.\n2. **Behavior/Style Check:** Be human, friendly, concise, and match the user's tone. Be honest if I don't understand or can't do something.\n3. **Action:** Explain that I cannot give financial advice and suggest he do his own research or consult a professional."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>I'm sorry, Zeeshan, but I can't tell you whether to go long or short on SOL. I don't give financial or trading advice. 😅 \n\nCrypto is super volatile—it’s always best to do your own research or talk to a professional before making any moves with your money! Good luck with your trading though. 🚀</final>"}],"api":"google-generative-ai","provider":"google","model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview","usage":{"input":13359,"output":203,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13562,"cost":{"input":0.00333975,"output":0.00030450000000000003,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00364425}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777484310200,"responseId":"HkLyaf6pObKrxN8Pj4f30Ak"}}
